**/.idea/shelf/
**/.idea/caches/
**/.idea/deviceManager.xml
**/.idea/deploymentTarget*.xml
**/.idea/runConfigurations.xml

# Additional Android Studio generated state
**/.externalNativeBuild/
**/captures/
